    <briefdescription>
<para>Stack Allocator - LIFO allocation pattern. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Allocation: O(1)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Deallocation: O(1) (must be LIFO)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Zero fragmentation (if LIFO respected)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Best for: Temporary allocations in scope </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
